OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F166A1795326454
OL,1,Wj5hw1~{4k7juhw1{$             G2/2
OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FOnce any mist or fog clears,
OL,6,Fanother mainly dry day with variable
OL,7,Fcloud and some bright or sunny spells.
OL,8,FRemaining rather cold with generally
OL,9,Flight winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,12,FTurning cloudier and windier Tuesday,
OL,13,Fwith rain probably arriving. Cloudy
OL,14,Fand breezy Wednesday with further rain
OL,15,Fpossible. Probably somewhat drier by
OL,16,FThursday, but remaining rather cloudy
OL,17,Fand chilly.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
